\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces System architecture and data flow of the BodhyaAI mentorship platform. The React frontend communicates with a Node.js backend, which orchestrates four AI microservices: Risk Analysis (XGBoost/Random Forest), Explainable AI (SHAP/LIME), Cognitive Profiling (BFI-44), and Generative MentorBot (Google Gemini API with local model fallback support). This modular data flow enables a continuous loop of \textit  {Predict} → \textit  {Explain} → \textit  {Understand} → \textit  {Act}.}}{4}{}\protected@file@percent }
